      "text": "MOA:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " polymyxin B: bactericidal vs many gram (-), esp P. aeruginosa; increases cell membrane permeability."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
