       }
      ],
      "text": "Treats:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " surface ocular infections incl acute bacterial conjunctivitis and blepharoconjunctivitis (S. aureus, S. epidermidis, S. pneumoniae, S. viridans, H. flu, P. aeruginosa)."
